OL,3,GNEWSASolar farm to power water facility
OL,4,Aapproved
OL,5,
OL,6,FA solar farm expected to power a water
OL,7,Ftreatment facility has been approved
OL,8,Fdespite concerns about the use of
OL,9,Fgreenfield sites.
OL,11,FThe project, on land off Vicarage Lane
OL,12,Fin Diddington in Cambridgeshire, is
OL,13,Fexpected to cover 45 hectares (111
OL,14,Facres) of farmland, making it
OL,15,Fequivalent to 63 football pitches.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,374,370,200,160,0,100
PN,37302
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F373A1790162768
OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSASolar farm to power water facility
OL,4,Aapproved
OL,5,
OL,6,FHuntingdonshire District Council
OL,7,Fapproved the plans but parish councils
OL,8,Fin Buckden and Southoe and Midloe
OL,9,Fobjected, stating greenfield sites
OL,10,Fshould not be used until other options,
OL,11,Fincluding brownfield sites, had been
OL,12,F"fully utilised".
OL,14,FCell Energy Limited, the company behind
OL,15,Fthe plans, said it had an agreement
OL,16,Fwith Anglian Water to provide the
OL,17,Fcompany with energy.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
